    "name": "Resilience",
    "steam_appid": 2643360,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643360/extras/54394eb7d77d318bd459cc194bcb4e41.avif?t=1750406742\" width=569 height=117 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resilience</h2> - An adventure game about survival on a planet with extreme temperature conditions. You will have to survive, gather resources, build a base, explore the planet, defend against aggressive flora and fauna, develop technologies, and find all crew members who are necessary for the development and operation of the base.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RESOURCE EXTRACTION</h2>Unlock the wealth of resources to pave the way for new grand adventures. The more you mine, the further you can penetrate into the endless extreme temperature zones, where exciting discoveries and challenges await.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643360/extras/f7715a47acca758f167b9ce11662ecf8.poster.avif?t=1750406742\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643360/extras/f7715a47acca758f167b9ce11662ecf8.webm?t=1750406742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CRAFTING</h2>Immerse yourself in the world of crafting, where every item is the result of your creativity. Use the mined resources for manual crafting or through various workbenches and machines located at your base.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643360/extras/1f3d5a56c37cd412e465a06f9dba2312.poster.avif?t=1750406742\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643360/extras/1f3d5a56c37cd412e465a06f9dba2312.webm?t=1750406742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONSTRUCTION</h2>Engage in an exciting construction process, where the creation of a base becomes your own creative work. Create cozy shelters or majestic space fortresses, reflecting your individual style and inspiration.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643360/extras/876ff8c65097689041b6883a1e9b52de.poster.avif?t=1750406742\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643360/extras/876ff8c65097689041b6883a1e9b52de.webm?t=1750406742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENCYCLOPEDIA</h2>Conduct encyclopedia using a scanner for a detailed study of the unknown flora and fauna of the planet. Enter the received data and observations into your personal journal, creating a valuable resource of information about the local ecosystem.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643360/extras/308fae28189d904431e967c0ab10a2bf.poster.avif?t=1750406742\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643360/extras/308fae28189d904431e967c0ab10a2bf.webm?t=1750406742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE ALONE OR WITH FRIENDS</h2>Want to play in a close-knit friendly company? Try the cooperative mode! In a cooperative of up to four players, you can jointly overcome difficulties and create exciting moments.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643360/extras/c43bf5933a8c7d45a19cecb48512feec.poster.avif?t=1750406742\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643360/extras/c43bf5933a8c7d45a19cecb48512feec.webm?t=1750406742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BIOMES WITH EXTREME TEMPERATURE CONDITIONS</h2>Explore extreme temperature zones: from -224 to +1200 degrees. Pass through heated sands and cracked ice to more extreme biomes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NPC ALLIES</h2>Open hibernation capsules, releasing colonists with unique skills. Attract them to work at your base in the interests of survival.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643360/extras/54394eb7d77d318bd459cc194bcb4e41.avif?t=1750406742\" width=569 height=117 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resilience</h2> - An adventure game about survival on a planet with extreme temperature conditions. You will have to survive, gather resources, build a base, explore the planet, defend against aggressive flora and fauna, develop technologies, and find all crew members who are necessary for the development and operation of the base.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RESOURCE EXTRACTION</h2>Unlock the wealth of resources to pave the way for new grand adventures. The more you mine, the further you can penetrate into the endless extreme temperature zones, where exciting discoveries and challenges await.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643360/extras/f7715a47acca758f167b9ce11662ecf8.poster.avif?t=1750406742\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643360/extras/f7715a47acca758f167b9ce11662ecf8.webm?t=1750406742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CRAFTING</h2>Immerse yourself in the world of crafting, where every item is the result of your creativity. Use the mined resources for manual crafting or through various workbenches and machines located at your base.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643360/extras/1f3d5a56c37cd412e465a06f9dba2312.poster.avif?t=1750406742\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643360/extras/1f3d5a56c37cd412e465a06f9dba2312.webm?t=1750406742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONSTRUCTION</h2>Engage in an exciting construction process, where the creation of a base becomes your own creative work. Create cozy shelters or majestic space fortresses, reflecting your individual style and inspiration.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643360/extras/876ff8c65097689041b6883a1e9b52de.poster.avif?t=1750406742\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643360/extras/876ff8c65097689041b6883a1e9b52de.webm?t=1750406742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENCYCLOPEDIA</h2>Conduct encyclopedia using a scanner for a detailed study of the unknown flora and fauna of the planet. Enter the received data and observations into your personal journal, creating a valuable resource of information about the local ecosystem.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643360/extras/308fae28189d904431e967c0ab10a2bf.poster.avif?t=1750406742\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643360/extras/308fae28189d904431e967c0ab10a2bf.webm?t=1750406742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE ALONE OR WITH FRIENDS</h2>Want to play in a close-knit friendly company? Try the cooperative mode! In a cooperative of up to four players, you can jointly overcome difficulties and create exciting moments.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643360/extras/c43bf5933a8c7d45a19cecb48512feec.poster.avif?t=1750406742\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643360/extras/c43bf5933a8c7d45a19cecb48512feec.webm?t=1750406742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BIOMES WITH EXTREME TEMPERATURE CONDITIONS</h2>Explore extreme temperature zones: from -224 to +1200 degrees. Pass through heated sands and cracked ice to more extreme biomes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NPC ALLIES</h2>Open hibernation capsules, releasing colonists with unique skills. Attract them to work at your base in the interests of survival.",
